### Locations
GET {{CIN7_BASE_URL}}/v2/ref/location?Page=1&Limit=50
api-auth-accountid: {{CIN7_ACCOUNT_ID}}
api-auth-applicationkey: {{CIN7_APPLICATION_KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Locations (deprecated only)
GET {{CIN7_BASE_URL}}/v2/ref/location?Deprecated=true
api-auth-accountid: {{CIN7_ACCOUNT_ID}}
api-auth-applicationkey: {{CIN7_APPLICATION_KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

